  m_text: 'You have just arrived at the cafe and begin

    taking customer orders.


    Everything
    seems normal until you notice

    a message from your boss.


    He needs an
    important financial report

    sent immediately because he has a meeting.


    The
    message was sent 17 minutes ago.


    You only have 3 minutes left.'
